  "releaseNotes": "Version 4.1.0: Added pooling policies (LIFO, FIFO, Priority, LRU, Round-Robin) for flexible retrieval strategies, IAsyncDisposable support for proper async cleanup, async validation for returned objects, enhanced AOT compatibility, and improved package quality with SourceLink and validation. 230+ tests passing with 100% success rate. Enterprise-ready with comprehensive monitoring and observability.",
